[profiles.guide]
notes = '''Hold {select} and {start} together to pause the gyro while you reposition the controller. Tilting the controller moves the pointer, as a fine pointer next to the right stick {rs}.
The right stick {rs} moves the pointer and the left stick {ls} pans the camera. {rt} or {south} clicks; hold {lt} and move the right stick {rs} to turn and tilt the camera. {up} and {down} zoom.
Hold {lb} for the build categories, aiming with the right stick {rs}. {select} holds the zoo dashboard: management, trading, heat maps, the move and copy tools, brush and path sizes, freelook, save and load.
{west} turns what you're placing a quarter; hold it and move the pointer to turn it freely. Hold {north} and move the pointer up or down to change its height, tap it to reset. Hold {rb} for Ctrl: lock to the surface's axes, select several pieces, invert a terrain brush, or place a path without joins.
{l3} switches angle snap. {r3} pauses; hold it to change the speed. {left} and {right} undo and redo. {east} cancels and deselects, {start} is the menu: double tap it for the save menu, hold it for the load menu.
Keys are the game's defaults from a community list, not read from an install: if one is off, check Settings → Controls. Naming an animal or a guest attraction: {guide} + {west} opens the on-screen keyboard.'''

